**452 certified cells with an exchangeable calibration set: 0 exceed the harm budget.**

24 further cells deliberately violate exchangeability (calibration and deployment drawn from different populations); 12 of those exceed the budget, which is the point of running them.

### cross-mask minus hard-label
Cross-mask uses no retrieval labels; hard-label needs one per pool element.

